= Malenyevist-wing members split

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Malenyevists who call for radical "social revolution" in Sordland. Their leaders, most notably Denis Stahler and Bernard Circas have split to form a new party, the CPS, or the Communist Party of Sordland. They do not count a huge section of our membership, nor contribute to our policies without the slightest bit of factionalism. This is survivable.

